#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fire the recorded gate-check seeds in disposable detached worktrees (p77).

Usage: uv run python .agent/seeds [--rev REV] [--only S01 ...] [--list]
       uv run python .agent/seeds --self-test

S01–S27 group the implemented recipes, with a result per executed case. Coverage
excludes wheel failure seeds, embedded-copy/umask replay, and owui-audit hold recipes.
rc 0 = every selected expectation matched and every worktree restored; 1 = a
verdict differs; 2 = setup/restoration failure. --self-test repeats the selected
set after neutralizing skip-census: exactly S12's four red seeds must change.
CPU-heavy (suites, D28 replays, a mutation run) ⇒ run the whole runner as one
scheduled job; it schedules nothing itself (machine commands → `CLAUDE.local.md`).
Network is required by uv
audit and uncached gitleaks, zizmor and shellcheck downloads. A private mirror keeps test commits, worktrees,
and D28 cache writes out of the calling repository. Existing GREEN D28 records
are copied as a cache only; D28 itself validates their content keys.
"""
